Package: pretestsim
Type: Package
Title: GitHub-Backed Interactive Studio for Adaptive Normality Pretesting
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Benedict", "Kongyir", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "kongyirbenkk@gmail.com")
Description: A Shiny dashboard and programmatic loader for the adaptive
    normality-pretesting framework. Framework R code, machine-learning support
    code, and trained model RData files are resolved from the package GitHub
    repository at runtime and cached locally, so the package works across
    Windows, macOS, and Linux without local absolute paths.
